    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "All that, for only a single Reunion squad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And a really big guy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that was the highlight. I'm totally exhausted just from dealing with him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could so many Infected vanish so quickly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that giant guy just a diversion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Reunion manage to completely evacuate this area in such a short period of time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... Madam Ch'en should have blocked off their escape route...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not seeing the designated waypoint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something... isn't right about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weeds, ruins, sand dunes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of which are potential spots for an ambush...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I'm not seeing anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "No footsteps, no sounds of clothing brushing against plants, no smell of explosives...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't tell what's going on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics, wake up and do your job!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't right at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
